        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SP7FBR, Solid Brass Strike Plate for Flush Bolts</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis strike plate fits <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\"><b>Deltana 7 Inch Flush Bolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/7-inch-flush-bolt-flip-lever-type-deltana-del-7fbz\"><b>Deltana 7 Inch Zinc Flush Bolts</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/18-inch-flush-bolt-flip-lever-type-deltana-del-18efbz\"><b>Deltana 18 Inch Flush Bolts</b></a>. Packaged with two (2) mounting screws. Available in 9 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SP7FBR-Speifications.gif?v=1704354593\" width=\"326\" height=\"207\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Flush Bolt Strike Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Flush Bolt Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
